.TH tine-block 1  "block " 
.SH NAME
tine\-block \- Read blocks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine block\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read blocks
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tine\-block\-show(1)
Show a block and its children by its id:: UUID
